# Every image, effect, animation and scene is authored outside Rust.
@scene meadow
background sunrise
panel notebook
"Dear diary: [[fx=ember]]embers[[/fx]] lit the sky, [[fx=shadow]]shadows[[/fx]] covered the path, and [[fx=shimmer]]starlight[[/fx]] crossed the page."
"Outside this illustrated journal, a walker, a bird, and a plane move on their own."
ambient hide bird
"The bird vanished behind the clouds. The other two actors keep moving."
ambient show bird
"Now the bird returns, and the story remains readable. Buenas noches, おやすみ."
* "Turn the journal page" -> last_page
* "Continue watching the meadow" -> meadow

@scene last_page
panel banner
"Last page: the diary turns into a letter, while [[fx=ember]]fire[[/fx]] and [[fx=shadow]]night[[/fx]] meet beyond the window."
"The End."
